  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3: iOS multicast reception fix. Multicast listener now binds to INADDR_ANY while still joining IGMP on the configured local interface — previously a locator constructed with a specific local IP would silently drop incoming multicast on Darwin/iOS due to strict BSD bind-address filtering. The receive loop also reconnects on generic socket exceptions instead of going silently deaf, and distinguishes the broadcast vs send socket so reconnect targets the right one.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
